refoucs}] fits the T2 based on Marty B et.al. Simultaneous muscle water T2 \
and fat fraction mapping using transverse relaxometry with stimulated echo \
compensation.\\nExitation and refocus are the RF pulse angles e.g. 90,180. \
They can also be a range of angeles over the slice profile as defined by \
GetSliceProfile.\\n\\nThe output is in units as defined by the detlaTE, e.g. \
if detlaTE is in ms the output is in ms.\\nThe exitation and refocus are \
defined in Degrees.\\n\\nOutput is {{{T2map,B1Map},{wat, fat, fatMap}, \
residual},callibration} or {{T2map,B1Map},{wat, fat, fatMap}, \
residual}\\n\\nEPGT2Fit[] is based on DOI: 10.1002/nbm.3459.\"\>", 
