eigenvalues {l1, l2, l3}.\nTensor[{l1, l2, l3}, \"Random\"] creates a \
diffuison tensor with random orthogonal eigenvectors {e1, e2, e2} and \
eigenvalues {l1, l2, l3}.\nTensor[{l1, l2, l3}, \"RandomZ\"] creates a \
diffuison tensor with random orthogonal eigenvectors {{1,0,0}, e2, e3} with \
random eigenvectors and eigenvalues {l1, l2, l3}.\nTensor[{l1, l2, l3}, \
\"OrtRandom\"] creates a diffuison tensor with random orthogonal eigenvectors \
{{1,0,0},{0,1,0},{0,0,1}} and eigenvalues {l1, l2, l3}.\n\nTensor[] is based \
on DOI: 10.1002/nbm.2959.", "Documentation" -> 
    Association["Local" -> "paclet:QMRITools/ref/Tensor"], "OwnValues" -> 
